    <DataNode elementId="AT2G40890-MONOMER" textLabel="AT2G40890-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="O22203" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="475" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The enzyme activity towards substrate 4-coumarate is low|CITS: [11967091]|. However, it very actively converts the shikimate and quinate esters of 4-coumarate|CITS: [11429408]|.</Comment>
